<title>USA: Frontier Insurance sets two-for-one split.</title>
<headline>Frontier Insurance sets two-for-one split.</headline>
<dateline>ROCK HILL, N.Y. 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Frontier Insurance Group Inc said its board has declared a two-for-one stock split in the form of a 100 percent stock dividend payable on July 21, record June 30.</p>
<p>The board also declared a quarterly cash dividend of $0.07 per share on the split shares also payable July 21, record June 30, effectively increasing the cash dividend by 7-1/2 percent.</p>
</text>
